  "title": "The Farm",
  "description": "A cozy Fabric farming modpack for Minecraft 1.21.1 with seasons, Farmer's Delight cooking, animals, beautiful countryside terrain and smooth performance.",
  "body": "# The Farm\n\nThe Farm is a cozy Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric modpack built around farming, seasons, food, animals, ambience and countryside exploration.\n\nPlant and harvest crops through the changing seasons, cook hearty meals, raise animals, and build a peaceful farm in a beautiful generated world. Discover villages and wildlife, and enjoy a relaxed survival experience backed by modern performance mods and visual polish.\n\n## Why Play The Farm?\n\n- **Farming and food progression** with Farmer's Delight Refabricated and Nemo's Farming\n- **Seasons** through Fabric Seasons, with seasonal farming compatibility\n- **Countryside world generation** with Terralith, Tectonic, Explorify and Wilder Wild\n- **Animals and nature**: villages, bees, mooblooms, snails and nature-focused exploration\n- **Ambience and visuals**: Fresh Animations, better leaves, ambient sounds, footsteps, particles and shader-friendly visuals\n- **Performance**: Sodium, Lithium, Iris, Indium and Dynamic FPS keep the game running smoothly\n- **Quality of life**: Waystones, Nature's Compass, Comforts, Carry On, BetterF3, REI and more\n\n## Perfect For\n\n- Cozy survival players and Vanilla+ fans\n- Anyone looking for a farming modpack, especially Farmer's Delight fans\n- Builders who want a peaceful countryside world\n- Players who want ambience, seasons, animals and exploration without heavy tech progression\n\n## Recommended\n\nShaders are optional but recommended for the best atmosphere. Use Iris with BSL, Complementary, or any shader you like.\n\n## Made for The Farm\n\n- **[Cotton](https://modrinth.com/mod/cotton)**: grow your own string\n- **[OrePlant](https://modrinth.com/mod/oreplant)**: grow iron, gold and diamonds as crops\n",
